asr-000062
00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:54.300
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Honorable members, distinguished colleagues, and esteemed guests,

asr-000063
00:04:54.620 --> 00:04:56.420
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Magandang hapon po sa ating lahat.

asr-000065
00:04:57.460 --> 00:05:05.880
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: We welcome our guests from the Commission on Audit, headed by our Chairperson, Gamaliel Cordoba.

asr-000066
00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:28.560
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: The Commission on Audit stands as a constitutional institution entrusted with a fundamental responsibility to safeguard the people's resources and ensure that public funds are collected, managed, and utilized in accordance with law.

asr-000067
00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:37.980
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: with accountability, transparency, economy, efficiency, and effectiveness.

asr-000068
00:05:39.380 --> 00:05:45.900
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: The proposed 2027 fiscal year budget of the Commission

asr-000069
00:05:45.900 --> 00:05:52.560
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: amounting to P16.046 billion

asr-000070
00:05:52.560 --> 00:06:00.580
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: is an investment in the country's system of public accountability,

asr-000071
00:06:01.700 --> 00:06:04.600
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: strengthen its audit operations,

asr-000072
00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:09.680
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: modernize its systems and processes,

asr-000073
00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:14.300
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: develop the capabilities of its personnel,

asr-000074
00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:23.980
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: and respond more effectively to the increasing complexity of government programs, transactions,

asr-000075
00:06:24.540 --> 00:06:26.720
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: and public expenditures.

asr-000076
00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:30.600
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: With the support of Congress,

asr-000077
00:06:31.840 --> 00:06:41.820
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: the Commission on Audit will continue to uphold its constitutional mandate with independence,

asr-000078
00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:45.740
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: professionalism, and integrity.

asr-000079
00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:48.980
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: We will strive to make

asr-000080
00:06:48.980 --> 00:06:57.160
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: public audit, not merely an exercise in detecting irregularities,

asr-000081
00:06:57.360 --> 00:07:02.520
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: but an instrument for improving government performance,

asr-000082
00:07:03.200 --> 00:07:11.880
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: preventing the wastage of public resources and strengthening public trust.

asr-000095
00:07:11.880 --> 00:07:29.640
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: The 16.046 billion proposed budget for fiscal year 2027 will help ensure that the Commission has the resources necessary to perform its mandate

asr-000096
00:07:29.640 --> 00:07:42.080
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: effectively and to remain a steadfast partner in promoting good governance and responsible stewardship of the nation's wealth.

asr-000097
00:07:42.240 --> 00:07:44.120
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Maraming salamat po.

asr-000098
00:07:55.780 --> 00:08:03.100
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Chairperson Gamaliel Cordoba, sir, you may now proceed with your presentation.

