asr-000105
00:09:03.740 --> 00:09:14.420
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: Then the next part is the budget of the Commission under the fiscal year 2027 National Expenditure Program.

asr-000106
00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:24.440
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: So with our major accomplishments categorized into two, the financial performance and the physical performance.

asr-000107
00:09:24.440 --> 00:09:43.640
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: For our financial performance for fiscal year 2025, COA received total allotment of 15,101,610,000 and this comprised of agency-specific budget.

asr-000108
00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:49.940
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: The special purpose fund, this is for the second trans-salary standardization.

asr-000109
00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:58.240
