asr-000110
00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:05.020
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: Then the retirement and life insurance premiums and the continuing appropriations.

asr-000111
00:10:05.020 --> 00:10:14.980
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: Out of this total allotment, we were able to obligate 14,702,701,000.

asr-000112
00:10:14.980 --> 00:10:30.660
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: or obligation rate of 97.36, resulting to a balance of unobligated allotment of 398,909,000.

asr-000113
00:10:30.660 --> 00:10:44.580
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: Out of the total obligations incurred, we dispersed 14,309,736,000, which is 97.33.

asr-000114
00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:52.880
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: Resulting to a balance of unpaid obligations of 392,965,000.

asr-000115
00:10:52.880 --> 00:11:09.860
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: For the first semester of fiscal year 2026, we received total allotment for the whole year of 2026, 15,773,503,000.

asr-000116
00:11:09.880 --> 00:11:21.100
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: And we were able to obligate 8,054,240,000 or 51.06%.

asr-000117
00:11:21.100 --> 00:11:37.200
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: Then we were able to disburse also 7,848,598,000 or 97.45% disbursement rate.

asr-000118
00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:50.680
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: Then we have the balance of unobligated allotment of 7,719,263,000.

asr-000121
00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:58.000
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: With unpaid obligations of 205,642,000.

