00:18:57.500 --> 00:19:03.040
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: for questioning or interpolation excluding the response of the resource

asr-000193
00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:15.200
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: persons and when you hear the bell sound it means you have only 30 seconds to

asr-000194
00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:22.740
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: wind up with your questions as part of a long-standing and respected tradition of

asr-000195
00:19:22.740 --> 00:19:29.720
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: the House, to accord preferential treatment to the minority members of the House,

asr-000196
00:19:29.840 --> 00:19:36.460
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: and followed by the independent and majority members in an alternating manner.

asr-000197
00:19:38.100 --> 00:19:39.400
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Okay, the Chair

asr-000198
00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:51.220
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: recognizes from the minority, the Honorable Representative Perci Cendaña, sir.

asr-000199
00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:57.040
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Thank you very much mr. chair magandang hapon po magandang hapon po as the chairperson

asr-000200
00:19:57.040 --> 00:20:01.620
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ng ating COA at sa buong COA family. Good afternoon po.

asr-000201
00:20:02.540 --> 00:20:07.700
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Good afternoon. At special shout out po doon sa atin pong galing pa sa region

asr-000202
00:20:07.700 --> 00:20:13.600
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: to join us today. Thank you for being with us. Yung una kong tanong ay, bukod po doon sa

asr-000203
00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:20.140
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: mga legit na bagyo, binabagyo ang bansa natin ng korupsyon. Ito pong nakaraang

asr-000204
00:20:20.140 --> 00:20:25.280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: taon hanggang ngayon ito po lagu yung top of mind issue when people think of

asr-000205
00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:25.720
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: government.

asr-000206
00:20:26.600 --> 00:20:32.640
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At ito po ay korupsyon sa issue ng flood control, hot facilities at iba pang infrastructure projects.

asr-000207
00:20:33.520 --> 00:20:40.620
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sa totoo lamang po, COWA dapat yung tatampal sa kamay ng korap at magsasabi na, huy, bawal yan.

asr-000208
00:20:41.960 --> 00:20:47.620
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pero sabi ng COWA last year, dalawa lang daw ang taga-audit natin ng flood control.

asr-000209
00:20:48.340 --> 00:20:53.760
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ang ending na ibulsa ang triliyong-triliyong pisong pera ng taong bayan.

asr-000210
00:20:54.380 --> 00:20:57.460
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ang tanong po ay, natuganan na po ba natin?

asr-000211
00:20:57.680 --> 00:21:01.880
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Natuganan po ba sa kasulukuyang budget yung gap na ito?

asr-000212
00:21:01.880 --> 00:21:06.800
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At sa ngayon po, ilan na po ba ang nahire from last year to this year, Mr. Chairperson?

asr-000213
00:21:08.000 --> 00:21:11.000
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Thank you very much, Kong Sendanya, for that question.

asr-000214
00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:20.980
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Tungkol po muna doon sa binanggit ninyo, doon po sa, I think you were referring to the 1st District Engineering Office of Bulacan.

asr-000215
00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:29.300
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Ang ginawa po namin, galing na po sa Central Office ang naging tugon po namin through the Fraud Audit Office.

asr-000216
00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:39.300
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: So, ang ginawa po namin ay nag-conduct na po kami ng Fraud Audit on marami na pong take-up na transaction po doon sa Bulacan.

asr-000217
00:21:39.460 --> 00:21:46.400
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Actually, I think we're able to have around 50 Fraud Audit, or 50 transactions.

asr-000218
00:21:46.860 --> 00:21:52.000
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: And ito nga po ang ginagamit na po ng ombudsman.

asr-000219
00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:55.840
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Una pong muna, nung wala po, nung una po ay sinabit po namin ito sa ICI.

asr-000220
00:21:56.520 --> 00:21:59.180
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: But noon pong natapos na po si ICI.

asr-000221
00:21:59.200 --> 00:22:00.560
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: We submitted everything to ombudsman.

asr-000222
00:22:00.680 --> 00:22:09.360
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Ito na po ang ginagamit ng ombudsman for the cases that are being tried in the preliminary investigation po sa kanila,

asr-000223
00:22:09.360 --> 00:22:11.180
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: and then sa Sandigan Bayan na po yung iba.

asr-000224
00:22:11.480 --> 00:22:17.600
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: And also, our auditors are the ones, mga naging witnesses po dito.

asr-000225
00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:24.700
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Tungkol naman po doon sa pag-hire, I think natugunan naman po kami ng DBM dahil humingi po kami ng tulong.

asr-000226
00:22:24.720 --> 00:22:28.800
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Sabi po namin, dati po kasi kulang sa Region 3.

asr-000227
00:22:28.800 --> 00:22:36.240
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: At saka po sa BARM, ang number of personnel, kasi po ay nabawasan po yun.

asr-000228
00:22:36.260 --> 00:22:43.820
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: So, nandito po si ASCOM Lord na Kabutyan para po explain po yung grinan po ng DBM sa amin, na number of personnel.

asr-000229
00:22:44.360 --> 00:22:45.000
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Salamat po.

asr-000230
00:22:46.100 --> 00:22:47.400
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: Good afternoon po.

asr-000231
00:22:48.600 --> 00:22:56.360
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: As early as 2020, when our OSSP po, yung plantilla possessions was approved,

asr-000232
00:22:56.880 --> 00:22:59.160
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: upon review,

asr-000233
00:22:59.480 --> 00:23:04.160
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: meron po kami nabawasan kami ng around 716 possessions.

asr-000234
00:23:04.160 --> 00:23:08.960
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: That's why we filed our MR with the DBM.

asr-000235
00:23:08.960 --> 00:23:18.600
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: And luckily po, this was favorably acted upon by the DBM last July po.

asr-000236
00:23:19.080 --> 00:23:25.640
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: And they already granted or restored the 332 possessions po.

asr-000237
00:23:25.640 --> 00:23:27.240
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: And basically po,

asr-000238
00:23:27.240 --> 00:23:36.980
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: ang merami po dito, like what the Chair mentioned, yung COWA-BARM po of 141 possessions because that time,

asr-000239
00:23:36.980 --> 00:23:40.080
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: this was deducted to our original plantilla.

asr-000240
00:23:41.420 --> 00:23:46.660
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: And COWA Region 3 of 123 and the others naman po,

asr-000241
00:23:46.660 --> 00:23:49.760
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: with the other offices na very minimal po.

asr-000242
00:23:49.860 --> 00:23:55.340
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: So we are very thankful po for the DBM in granting po yung MR namin.

asr-000243
00:23:55.640 --> 00:24:04.240
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: Out of 716, we were restored to 332 positions.

asr-000244
00:24:05.100 --> 00:24:06.980
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So ilan pa po ang kailangan natin?

asr-000245
00:24:08.080 --> 00:24:17.600
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: So the balance po ng 716, less 332 po is around mga almost 400 pa po.

asr-000246
00:24:18.260 --> 00:24:22.360
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So more than half pa yung kailangan natin from the original.

asr-000247
00:24:23.340 --> 00:24:25.140
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Is this a cause for concern?

asr-000248
00:24:26.700 --> 00:24:28.900
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: Yes po, it's a cause for concern.

asr-000249
00:24:28.900 --> 00:24:36.940
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: Because as the agencies are adding and as present,

asr-000250
00:24:37.200 --> 00:24:41.380
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: medyo kulang na rin ang mga auditors natin in the field.

asr-000251
00:24:41.700 --> 00:24:51.460
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: And aside from yung separation, meron din po kaming data on the separation of our auditors

asr-000252
00:24:51.460 --> 00:24:56.300
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: less than 10 years who were staying with us.

asr-000253
00:24:56.300 --> 00:25:04.660
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: During the exit interview, mas preferable po sa kanila yung higher pay

asr-000254
00:25:04.660 --> 00:25:11.580
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: and proximity po sa residence nila and yung flexible working arrangement po.

asr-000255
00:25:11.580 --> 00:25:23.660
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: So, though we are continually recruiting, meron din po kasing separation through transfer

asr-000256
00:25:23.660 --> 00:25:26.820
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: po sa ibang government agencies and resignation.

asr-000257
00:25:27.750 --> 00:25:34.720
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: And of course, also po ngayon, they are considering to retire at the age of 60 na po.

asr-000258
00:25:34.900 --> 00:25:44.560
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: They wouldn't wait for 65 po. as soon as they reach the age of 60, they are availing the optional retirement.

asr-000262
00:25:45.880 --> 00:25:48.360
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Chair, sa totoo lamang po,

asr-000263
00:25:48.400 --> 00:25:50.900
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: medyo alarming itong trend na ito.

asr-000264
00:25:50.900 --> 00:25:53.320
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mas lalo ding alarming na kulang na kulang

asr-000265
00:25:53.320 --> 00:25:54.960
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: pa rin pala hanggang ngayon.

asr-000266
00:25:55.540 --> 00:26:02.520
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ngayong 2027 po, may proposed 107 billion pesos para sa flood control under DPWH.

asr-000267
00:26:03.360 --> 00:26:09.260
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pagpalpak uli ang audit or kapag kulang, mabagal ang audit, repeat performance tayo sa 2025.

asr-000268
00:26:09.900 --> 00:26:13.920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At alam na po natin kung ano yung dahilan. Ito nga po nabanggit natin nakakulangan.

asr-000269
00:26:14.200 --> 00:26:21.240
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: on top of yung budgetary needs po natin, may plano ba ang COA na i-enhance ang capacity ng special audit teams

asr-000270
00:26:21.240 --> 00:26:24.980
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: para maimbestigahan kung may gross and anomalous flood control projects ulit.

asr-000271
00:26:27.840 --> 00:26:30.340
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Si Commissioner Douglas Malilin po ang magsasakit.

asr-000272
00:26:34.120 --> 00:26:39.000
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Magandang hapon po. May mga reforma po na ginagawa po ang COA.

asr-000273
00:26:40.720 --> 00:26:47.500
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Habang may kakulangan po ang aming budget lalo na ho sa capital outlay at may kakulangan din ho sa tao,

asr-000274
00:26:47.700 --> 00:26:54.260
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: may mga ginagawa ho kaming pamamaraan para mapabilis naman ho yung natututunan ng mga tao.

asr-000275
00:26:56.440 --> 00:27:05.580
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Sa ngayon po, sa kabuuan ng lahat po ng regions namin, sinasalang ho namin sila sa mga mabibigat hon training courses

asr-000276
00:27:05.580 --> 00:27:14.520
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: for data analytics po. Ito lang po ang pamamaraan ho namin ngayon dahil ang traditional ng audit ho

asr-000277
00:27:14.520 --> 00:27:21.560
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: ay madalas alam namin na dinadaan ho sa papel. But with the present technology that we have

asr-000278
00:27:21.560 --> 00:27:24.400
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: and with what we have in the basic technology, we have the ability to do that.

asr-000279
00:27:32.240 --> 00:27:39.140
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: At the same time po, tinitingnan niyo namin yung mga ahensya na mapabago ho namin yung sistema.

asr-000280
00:27:40.740 --> 00:27:49.140
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Kung mamarapatin po namin ang accounting processes ho ng COA na isiniwalat ho namin sa lahat ng ahensya

asr-000281
00:27:49.140 --> 00:27:53.160
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: ay nasa salubo ng kinatawag ho namin government accounting manual.

asr-000282
00:27:53.160 --> 00:28:00.420
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Kung titignan ho natin itong government accounting manual, may kalumaan na ho, bago ho yung issuance noong 2015.

asr-000283
00:28:00.760 --> 00:28:06.440
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Pero yung mga proseso ho ng COA, inaamin ho namin marami na ho kailangan palitan.

asr-000284
00:28:07.420 --> 00:28:08.620
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Napaparami ho yung papel.

asr-000285
00:28:09.120 --> 00:28:15.700
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Naiiba naman ho yung tawag ng teknolohiya. So binabago po namin yun.

asr-000286
00:28:15.780 --> 00:28:22.440
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: So simula proseso ho hanggang kung anuman ng teknolohiya ang pwede namin gamitin ay ginagamit po namin ngayon.

asr-000287
00:28:23.440 --> 00:28:32.640
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Meron ho kaming iminungkahi noong nakaraang taon but because of the budget constraints,

asr-000288
00:28:33.220 --> 00:28:39.100
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: ang ginawa ho namin muna ay kung ano lang muna magagawa in terms of what technology we can use.

asr-000289
00:28:39.580 --> 00:28:45.900
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: At the same time po, meron nilabas po ang COA na resolution at circular po na geotagging.

asr-000290
00:28:46.600 --> 00:28:51.380
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Nakita ho namin na malaking bagay ho ito sa mga infrastructure projects.

asr-000291
00:28:52.800 --> 00:29:06.440
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: We are coordinating po with DPWH so that yung geotagging requirements and our other stricter requirements po ay hindi naman po makasagabal sa kailangan ho nilang magampanan na proyekto.

asr-000292
00:29:06.560 --> 00:29:14.080
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Dahil pag sumobra naman po ang nagiging requirements at bumagal po yung pangangailangan, binabalansi ho namin ito.

asr-000293
00:29:15.600 --> 00:29:19.680
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Noong nakaraang taon, there was also a suggestion for pre-audit.

asr-000294
00:29:21.420 --> 00:29:29.500
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: May kaakibat na budget din po ito pero ang ginagawa namin in the middle ground.

asr-000295
00:29:29.660 --> 00:29:37.700
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: We are looking at ways and means po, para lang magkaroon ho ng continuous audit without exactly it being a pre-audit.

asr-000296
00:29:38.120 --> 00:29:40.940
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Marami hong mga programa ngayon sa loob ng COA.

asr-000297
00:29:41.540 --> 00:29:47.200
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Ang tinututukan namin ngayon muna po ay ang kaalaman ng mga tao to upskill them.

asr-000298
00:29:47.200 --> 00:29:48.180
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Dahil

asr-000299
00:29:48.180 --> 00:29:52.620
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Kung kulang kami sa tao at madalas nawawalan, di po kami ng tao.

asr-000300
00:29:52.900 --> 00:29:56.940
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: We take a look at technology as the response po.

asr-000301
00:29:57.220 --> 00:29:58.200
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Maraming salamat po.

asr-000302
00:29:58.820 --> 00:30:05.740
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Chair, napakabait po ng pagka-frame ng ating COA Commissioner nung sinabi niya na kulang yung kanilang capital outlay.

asr-000303
00:30:05.860 --> 00:30:10.680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pero pag binilikan po natin yung budget pa, zero po ang capital outlay ng COA.

asr-000304
00:30:10.880 --> 00:30:18.760
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ano po ang impact nitong zero capital outlay sa pag-acquire natin ng necessary technologies para mas paigihin po ang ating trabaho sa loob ng COA?

asr-000305
00:30:22.460 --> 00:30:31.800
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Meron po kaming, yung pamamaraan po namin ngayon po ay turuan po ng mga tauhan po namin ng tamang paggamit po ng teknolohiya.

asr-000306
00:30:32.600 --> 00:30:38.780
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: We basically have two items po that we have been doing since last year.

asr-000307
00:30:38.780 --> 00:30:47.100
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Data analytics, at the same time po we're taking a look at enhancing po yung citizens participatory audit.

asr-000308
00:30:48.380 --> 00:30:51.320
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: So kung kulang man po ang tao, pero matatapos.

asr-000309
00:30:51.880 --> 00:30:59.960
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: At po namin ang publiko, mga NGOs, mga CSOs po, na tulungan po kami sa audit, nakakadagdag manpower din po ito.

asr-000310
00:31:00.360 --> 00:31:15.240
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Yun nga lang po, kasama po sa hiling namin na budget po for this program, yung citizens participatory audit, mukhang may kakulangan din po sa larangan po nung budget for that aspect po.

asr-000311
00:31:15.320 --> 00:31:21.760
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: So overall po, despite the lack of a capital outlay, we do what we can.

asr-000312
00:31:22.560 --> 00:31:33.380
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Pero mas maganda po kung magpagbigyan po kami sa area po ng dagdag capital outlay po, dagdag opisina, dagdag teknolohiya, hardware and software po.

asr-000313
00:31:33.820 --> 00:31:41.680
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Mas maganda po ang magiging performance po ng audit dahil mag-iiba po ang landscape of how we audit.

asr-000314
00:31:42.100 --> 00:31:45.040
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Hindi na po yung papel po ang inahanap po namin.

asr-000315
00:31:45.440 --> 00:31:49.960
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Ang nangyayari po is magiging mas analytic po ang mga auditors po natin.

asr-000316
00:31:50.200 --> 00:31:51.280
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Maraming salamat po.

asr-000317
00:31:51.580 --> 00:32:01.860
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Again po, nakababahala itong zero capital outlay para sa COA, lalo na sa panahon kailangan-kailangan natin i-bolster yung capacity ng ahensya, lalo na pagdating sa software at hardware.

asr-000318
00:32:02.200 --> 00:32:09.580
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: The only way for us to be more efficient is with efficient use of technology at hindi po yan hinuhugot sa hangin, kailangan po ang capital outlay.

asr-000319
00:32:09.700 --> 00:32:20.240
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: And we hope that the committee will really work with COA in restoring the capital outlay proposal of COA, lalo na po sa panahon ito na matinding korupsyon.

asr-000320
00:32:20.480 --> 00:32:21.780
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Nabagid nyo po kanina.

asr-000321
00:32:22.140 --> 00:32:31.200
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mayroong pre-audit systems. Ano po ba ang kailangan nating budgetary support para po sa staffing, training at implementation ng ating pre-audit system?

asr-000322
00:32:35.700 --> 00:32:46.180
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Mr. Chair, meron po kaming, ito po yung tinake up na rin po natin last year based on the question of Congressman Romeo Momo.

asr-000323
00:32:48.060 --> 00:32:55.560
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: We have computation kasama po ang salaries, etc.

asr-000324
00:32:55.760 --> 00:32:56.780
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Lahat po ng kailangan.

asr-000325
00:32:56.780 --> 00:33:07.080
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: We will have 146 additional pre-audit teams composed of various audit technical and administrative positions.

asr-000326
00:33:07.080 --> 00:33:09.380
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: We can submit it po to the committee.

asr-000327
00:33:09.720 --> 00:33:13.780
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Lahat-lahat na po ito, more or less around 2.5 billion po ito.

asr-000328
00:33:13.780 --> 00:33:24.260
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Pero sa tingin po namin, sulit po ito dahil bigyan ko po kayong statistics just for this year, your honors, sa DPWH lang po ang na-issue po na notice,

asr-000329
00:33:24.260 --> 00:33:35.380
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: ang notice of suspension na na-issue ng ating mga auditors sa DPWH is already 107.771 billion.

asr-000330
00:33:36.140 --> 00:33:42.420
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: At ang notice of disallowance na na-issue po is 51.27 billion.

asr-000331
00:33:42.420 --> 00:33:45.780
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Of course, iba-iba na po ang stages ito ngayon dahil may appeal, etc.

asr-000332
00:33:46.240 --> 00:33:53.980
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: But the total amount that was issued for DPWH only for this year is already 158 billion pesos.

asr-000333
00:33:54.460 --> 00:33:55.600
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Can you imagine po?

asr-000334
00:33:55.600 --> 00:34:01.540
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Ang magagagawa natin kung madadagdagan po ng 148 pre-audit teams.

asr-000335
00:34:02.020 --> 00:34:08.940
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Tama ba? 148 pre-audit teams ang ating Commission on Audit.

asr-000336
00:34:08.940 --> 00:34:18.900
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Napakalaking bagay po. Dito pa lang po sa existing natin ngayon, we already were able to do actions on 158 billion pesos.

asr-000337
00:34:18.900 --> 00:34:20.020
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Thank you.

asr-000338
00:34:20.020 --> 00:34:22.860
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Marami pong salamat and we support you on this call.

asr-000339
00:34:22.860 --> 00:34:24.980
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Lalo na po, napakahalaga ng pre-audit teams.

asr-000340
00:34:25.720 --> 00:34:29.780
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kayo po talaga ang frontliners at first line of defense against corruption.

asr-000341
00:34:29.780 --> 00:34:34.920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kaya nga po, hindi ko maintindihan na while the government is saying na ang priority ay anti-corruption,

asr-000342
00:34:34.920 --> 00:34:41.800
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: hindi po ba dapat binibigay natin ng dagdag na sandata, dagdag na resources at investment ang COA.

asr-000343
00:34:42.000 --> 00:34:48.040
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kaya po, medyo I still find it quite difficult to believe na zero ang nilagay sa ating capital outlay

asr-000344
00:34:48.040 --> 00:34:52.460
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: at ngayon ay bitin-bitin pa rin tayo padating po sa mga needs natin in terms of personnel.

asr-000345
00:34:52.700 --> 00:34:55.260
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Let me just go back to the issue of flood control.

asr-000346
00:34:56.700 --> 00:35:04.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Meron po ba tayong audit reforms na in-implement para pigilan ang license, renting schemes at contractor monopolies?

asr-000347
00:35:10.320 --> 00:35:13.060
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Para sagutin ko po yung tanong po ninyo.

asr-000348
00:35:14.360 --> 00:35:17.920
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Nung nagsimula po nagkaroon ng kontrobersiya po ang PICAB,

asr-000349
00:35:18.390 --> 00:35:23.300
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: ang mga auditors po namin in the auditing PICAB po ay tumutok na po.

asr-000350
00:35:24.070 --> 00:35:27.600
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Ang unahong tinignan nila dahil dito po nang gagaling ang...

asr-000351
00:35:28.960 --> 00:35:34.120
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Yung malaking parte ng problema po ng PICAB ay ang qualifications po at yung conflict of...

asr-000352
00:35:34.120 --> 00:35:36.060
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: possible conflict of interest.

asr-000353
00:35:36.280 --> 00:35:37.640
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Dito po unang nagkaroon ng problema.

asr-000354
00:35:39.280 --> 00:35:46.360
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: But more so po, ang tinignan po namin ay ang kadikit po niyang mga sistema po sa loob ng DPWH.

asr-000355
00:35:47.200 --> 00:35:51.280
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Dahil po, inaayos na rin po ng DPWH yung mga sistema nila.

asr-000356
00:35:51.580 --> 00:35:53.660
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: We are coordinating po with them.

asr-000357
00:35:53.960 --> 00:35:56.680
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: So we're taking a look at all their data po.

asr-000358
00:35:56.680 --> 00:35:58.900
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: So that moving forward...

asr-000359
00:35:58.960 --> 00:36:06.460
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Nakikita po natin, magkakaroon na po tayo ng idea kung sino ho yung mga contractor na medyo malalaki ho yung proyekto.

asr-000360
00:36:06.580 --> 00:36:09.860
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Sino yung nakakakuha sa bawat area.

asr-000361
00:36:10.340 --> 00:36:15.040
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: So ang nangyayari po dito is we can do reverse engineering po.

asr-000362
00:36:15.430 --> 00:36:20.040
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Kung ano ho yung nakikita natin nakakakuha po ng kontrata o sumasali po sa bidding,

asr-000363
00:36:20.300 --> 00:36:24.140
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: nakikita po natin we tie it back po sa PICAB data.

asr-000364
00:36:24.900 --> 00:36:28.660
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Nung una po, pag ina-audit namin ng PICAB, it is more of a...

asr-000365
00:36:29.920 --> 00:36:34.940
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: But because of what happened po, pinapasok namin ho yung ibang modes of audit namin.

asr-000366
00:36:35.600 --> 00:36:38.600
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Compliance, performance audit, at meron pang iba pa.

asr-000367
00:36:39.020 --> 00:36:47.560
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Kaya ang pinapalakas po namin yung areas of weaknesses, lalo na po at this point in time where we saw the deficiencies po.

asr-000368
00:36:47.560 --> 00:36:55.960
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: At naging red flag po sa COA at pinalakas din po namin yung sa side po namin ng COA kung ano po dapat namin gawin.

asr-000369
00:36:56.140 --> 00:36:56.920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Salamat po.

asr-000370
00:36:57.880 --> 00:36:58.820
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Maraming salamat.

asr-000371
00:36:59.420 --> 00:37:09.820
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Chair, may the committee kindly direct the Commission on Audit to submit a progress report on these efforts pertaining to license renting and contractor monopolies.

asr-000372
00:37:09.920 --> 00:37:10.660
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-000373
00:37:10.820 --> 00:37:14.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: And for my last set of questions, simple lamang po.

asr-000374
00:37:16.400 --> 00:37:18.820
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Napakahalaga po talaga ng AAR, no po?

asr-000375
00:37:19.260 --> 00:37:25.340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At nabanggit po ninyo na ang deadline ng annual audit reports ay September 2026.

asr-000376
00:37:26.520 --> 00:37:28.160
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: September na po next week, no?

asr-000377
00:37:28.300 --> 00:37:36.760
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: May we ask the COA kung ilang percent na po ng mga agencies ang nakapag-submit ng kanilang AARs for 2025 at ilan pa po ang hinihintayin natin?

asr-000378
00:37:37.060 --> 00:37:42.180
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Natanong ko po ito kasi inaabangan po talaga namin sa inyong website yung publication ng mga AARs.

asr-000379
00:37:46.320 --> 00:37:47.160
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: For

asr-000380
00:37:47.160 --> 00:37:57.620
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: the annual audit reports, the deadline of the transmittal to the audited agency was June 30.

asr-000381
00:37:58.080 --> 00:38:00.420
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: Then we have 60 days from the...

asr-000382
00:38:00.420 --> 00:38:11.280
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: Transmittal for requiring the audited agency to submit the actions taken on the audit observations and recommendations.

asr-000383
00:38:11.280 --> 00:38:23.240
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: Then these actions taken by the management will be appended to the annual audit report to be published in the COA website.

asr-000384
00:38:23.640 --> 00:38:29.260
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: So we are given until October 31 to publish the annual audit reports.

asr-000385
00:38:30.760 --> 00:38:35.020
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ibig sabihin po, nakasabing na po ang lahat ng mga ahensya o ilang percent na po ang nakasabing?

asr-000386
00:38:35.140 --> 00:38:37.640
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: No, transmitted to the audited agencies.

asr-000387
00:38:37.820 --> 00:38:41.120
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: To the audited agencies. Okay. Sige po. Marami pong salamat.

asr-000388
00:38:41.280 --> 00:38:53.080
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Siguro po as a last point, we say that anti-corruption is a priority of the government and yet we do not see this in the allocation that was given to COA.

asr-000389
00:38:53.440 --> 00:38:59.260
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kung sinasabi po natin na ang budget ang pinakakongkreta expression of the priorities of government,

asr-000390
00:38:59.480 --> 00:39:00.740
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: then it seems like...

asr-000391
00:39:00.740 --> 00:39:09.640
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Based on this budget, particularly yung nakababahalang zero capital outlay sa panahon na kailangan-kailangan natin ng teknolihiya ay hindi binigay sa COA.

asr-000392
00:39:09.640 --> 00:39:20.020
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So again, we question if truly anti-corruption is the priority if it's not reflective of yung investments na niligay sa napakahalagang ahensya ng ito.

asr-000393
00:39:20.060 --> 00:39:28.000
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Muli po kayo ang ating frontliners at first time defense against corruption at sana mabigyan kayo ng sapat na support ng gobyerno.

asr-000394
00:39:28.060 --> 00:39:29.760
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mabuhay po kayo. Salamat po, Mr. Chair.

asr-000395
00:39:32.360 --> 00:39:34.800
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Thank you, Representative Cendaña.

asr-000396
00:39:34.800 --> 00:39:44.540
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: We now call from the majority, Representative Mauricio Domogan, sir.

asr-000397
00:39:44.560 --> 00:39:47.020
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

asr-000398
00:39:47.020 --> 00:39:56.480
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Good afternoon, the COA family, leaded by our chairperson, Apo Cordoba.

asr-000399
00:39:56.480 --> 00:40:00.260
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: I was the one who brought last year.

asr-000400
00:40:03.400 --> 00:40:07.540
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Siguro walang nanakaw kung hindi natin inalis yung pre-audit.

asr-000401
00:40:08.780 --> 00:40:11.680
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Umuon naman kayo last year to that effect.

asr-000402
00:40:12.260 --> 00:40:17.900
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Yung problema lang, sabi ninyo, kulang yung manpower.

asr-000403
00:40:19.080 --> 00:40:21.460
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Relative to the question of Congressman Zindania,

asr-000404
00:40:23.180 --> 00:40:27.580
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: bakit hindi natin binigyan ng priority?

asr-000405
00:40:27.580 --> 00:40:31.540
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Yung increase sa personal...

asr-000406
00:40:31.540 --> 00:40:33.140
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: services.

asr-000407
00:40:33.540 --> 00:40:41.340
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: So that we hire additional auditors that will be conducting pre-audit.

asr-000408
00:40:43.140 --> 00:40:51.040
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Actually, I filed already a bill pursuant to what we had discussed last year.

asr-000409
00:40:51.840 --> 00:40:58.080
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Making pre-audit coupled with geo-mapping

asr-000410
00:40:58.080 --> 00:41:02.360
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: as mandatory requisite of

asr-000411
00:41:02.360 --> 00:41:07.220
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: payment of government projects.

asr-000412
00:41:07.980 --> 00:41:10.960
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Kasi kung ginawa natin ito,

asr-000413
00:41:12.240 --> 00:41:16.740
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: imposible na may ghost project na nababayaran.

asr-000414
00:41:18.060 --> 00:41:23.020
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: As we all know, post-audit usually concentrate on the record submitted.

asr-000415
00:41:23.660 --> 00:41:28.680
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Di masyado tinitingnan yung project. O, nakakalusot na.

asr-000416
00:41:28.820 --> 00:41:32.220
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: So I hope that COA,

asr-000417
00:41:32.220 --> 00:41:36.300
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: should support this bill.

asr-000418
00:41:36.820 --> 00:41:39.460
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: And my question now is,

asr-000419
00:41:40.400 --> 00:41:44.600
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: do we have an amount that we need

asr-000420
00:41:44.600 --> 00:41:47.840
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: to augment yung inyong budget

asr-000421
00:41:47.840 --> 00:41:50.560
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: for 2027

asr-000422
00:41:50.560 --> 00:41:56.700
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: in order to hire the necessary personnels

asr-000423
00:41:56.700 --> 00:42:00.940
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: to perform pre-audit

asr-000424
00:42:00.940 --> 00:42:02.380
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: coupled with

asr-000426
00:42:02.380 --> 00:42:04.780
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: geo-mapping?

asr-000427
00:42:07.800 --> 00:42:09.200
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Maraming salamat po, Apo.

asr-000428
00:42:10.420 --> 00:42:11.400
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: First of all po,

asr-000429
00:42:11.440 --> 00:42:17.300
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: we manifest our support for your pending bill.

asr-000430
00:42:17.440 --> 00:42:19.060
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Kung kailangan po kaming mag-attend

asr-000431
00:42:19.060 --> 00:42:22.980
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: or maging resource person po sa inyong pending bill,

asr-000432
00:42:23.060 --> 00:42:26.060
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: we are ready to help po doon.

asr-000433
00:42:26.060 --> 00:42:31.720
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Secondly po, tungkol po dun sa amount that you mentioned,

asr-000434
00:42:31.900 --> 00:42:33.980
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: we already submitted na rin po ito.

asr-000435
00:42:33.980 --> 00:42:35.960
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Last year, but we will resubmit it again.

asr-000436
00:42:35.960 --> 00:42:37.040
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: At meron na po kami.

asr-000437
00:42:37.860 --> 00:42:39.360
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Tulad po ng nabanggit ko kanina,

asr-000438
00:42:39.560 --> 00:42:43.420
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: we would need additional 146 pre-audit teams

asr-000439
00:42:43.420 --> 00:42:47.060
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: composed of several personnel per team.

asr-000440
00:42:47.060 --> 00:42:49.660
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: And nandito na po yung whole amount.

asr-000441
00:42:49.660 --> 00:42:55.500
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Our estimate is around 2.2 billion po for pre-audit.

asr-000442
00:42:55.560 --> 00:42:58.380
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: But 2.2 billion pesos.

asr-000443
00:42:58.520 --> 00:43:00.280
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: But actually po, as I have mentioned earlier,

asr-000444
00:43:00.540 --> 00:43:02.440
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: napaka maliit po ito

asr-000445
00:43:02.440 --> 00:43:04.240
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: kumpara po sa magiging action.

asr-000446
00:43:04.660 --> 00:43:07.180
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: If we have this, kapalis po nang sinabi ko kanina,

asr-000447
00:43:07.260 --> 00:43:08.700
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: even without this,

asr-000448
00:43:09.420 --> 00:43:11.340
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: ang na-issue po na NS,

asr-000449
00:43:11.640 --> 00:43:16.120
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: or Notice of Suspension ng aming DPWH team,

asr-000450
00:43:16.340 --> 00:43:19.240
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: ay 107 billion na po agad.

asr-000451
00:43:19.240 --> 00:43:20.540
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: So kung titigan niyo po,

asr-000452
00:43:20.660 --> 00:43:23.440
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: yung butal pa lang po noon ay katapat na po nito.

asr-000453
00:43:23.640 --> 00:43:26.460
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: And then meron pa pong NDNCs

asr-000454
00:43:26.460 --> 00:43:30.720
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: na na-issue na 51 of total of 158 billion.

asr-000455
00:43:31.060 --> 00:43:34.320
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Doon pa lang po sa butal ay ito pong gastos na to.

asr-000456
00:43:34.320 --> 00:43:36.360
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: So sa 2.1 ay kuwang-kuwa na po, Your Honors.

asr-000457
00:43:36.780 --> 00:43:37.340
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Salamat po.

asr-000459
00:43:38.640 --> 00:43:40.260
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Chairman, thank you.

asr-000460
00:43:40.400 --> 00:43:43.940
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Presiding Officer.

asr-000461
00:43:43.940 --> 00:43:48.540
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: I am sure not only me,

asr-000462
00:43:48.640 --> 00:43:50.880
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: but my colleagues will support

asr-000463
00:43:50.880 --> 00:43:54.240
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: the motion later on in the floor.

asr-000464
00:43:54.320 --> 00:43:57.120
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Nadagdagan yung inyong budget to comply with this one.

asr-000465
00:43:57.240 --> 00:43:59.600
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: If we are really serious to fight

asr-000466
00:43:59.600 --> 00:44:01.240
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: corruption,

asr-000467
00:44:04.380 --> 00:44:06.480
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: pinapakinggan ko yung presentation ninyo eh,

asr-000468
00:44:06.480 --> 00:44:08.120
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: may additional personnel.

asr-000469
00:44:08.120 --> 00:44:08.860
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Ngunit,

asr-000470
00:44:08.860 --> 00:44:13.300
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: hindi nakatutok sa talagang requirement.

asr-000471
00:44:13.880 --> 00:44:14.780
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Parang ito nga,

asr-000472
00:44:14.840 --> 00:44:16.680
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: mapigil itong ano.

asr-000473
00:44:16.800 --> 00:44:17.340
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Imagine,

asr-000474
00:44:17.480 --> 00:44:21.740
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: aabot ng halos billion-billions yung nawala.

asr-000475
00:44:22.920 --> 00:44:23.340
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Kasi,

asr-000476
00:44:23.340 --> 00:44:26.060
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: if you look at what happened,

asr-000477
00:44:26.580 --> 00:44:28.440
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: pre-audit was being done.

asr-000478
00:44:28.760 --> 00:44:31.940
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: It was only removed in 2011.

asr-000479
00:44:33.220 --> 00:44:33.900
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: That was,

asr-000480
00:44:33.900 --> 00:44:35.420
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: what happened.

asr-000481
00:44:36.140 --> 00:44:36.780
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: And eh,

asr-000482
00:44:39.040 --> 00:44:42.280
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: yung talagang ghost projects na nababayaran,

asr-000483
00:44:43.100 --> 00:44:44.300
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: yun na nangyari.

asr-000484
00:44:45.160 --> 00:44:45.800
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: See,

asr-000485
00:44:45.920 --> 00:44:48.380
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: I remember the rehabilitation of Baguio

asr-000486
00:44:48.380 --> 00:44:50.500
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: from the ruins of the killer quick.

asr-000487
00:44:50.740 --> 00:44:52.360
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: And I am happy that we have some

asr-000488
00:44:52.360 --> 00:44:57.100
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: graduates of Baguio here with the commission.

asr-000489
00:44:57.460 --> 00:44:58.140
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: A lot of you.

asr-000490
00:44:58.140 --> 00:45:05.160
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: A lot of you, even the one who testified in the impeachment is from Erisan Bagusitian, graduate of St. Louis University.

asr-000491
00:45:08.280 --> 00:45:20.360
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Eh, siyong ko siguro may balik natin yan, malaking bagay sa ating gobyerno if again we are serious of addressing this issue of corruption.

asr-000492
00:45:21.780 --> 00:45:34.920
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Eh, hindi siguro lulusot yung ano. Kasi kung may pre-audit coupled with geo-tagging or mapping, talagang maliwanag na nandyan na yung project.

asr-000493
00:45:36.880 --> 00:45:42.620
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Eh, hindi yung ghost projects pagkatapos full payment. Ano naman yan?

asr-000494
00:45:44.120 --> 00:45:50.420
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Eh, yung talagang maliwanag na nangyayari, pinapayagan natin yung magnanakaw na.

asr-000495
00:45:51.500 --> 00:45:58.220
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Magnanakaw ka muna bago namin kayo kabulin. Asan tayo ngayon? Mahabol mo pa ng nasa Amerika.

asr-000496
00:45:58.220 --> 00:46:04.100
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Hindi pa natin alam kung asan siya at this point in time.

asr-000497
00:46:04.100 --> 00:46:10.200
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: So, thank you for your manifestation to support this one.

asr-000498
00:46:10.620 --> 00:46:20.620
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Eh, well, I was about to ask, alright, the result of your audit na pinakita ninyo, ilan yan yung na-issue ng AOM at Notice of Order?

asr-000500
00:46:22.800 --> 00:46:35.280
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Yun pong sa nangyayari po dun sa DPWH sa Bulacan, we're able to have fraud audit po sa 50 projects. Lahat po yun ay na-issuean po namin.

asr-000501
00:46:35.280 --> 00:46:37.800
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Yeah, but for this year, 2026.

asr-000502
00:46:37.800 --> 00:46:46.120
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Ah, okay. Ito po. Ang na-issuean po namin ng NS na po, Notice of Suspension of Payment is 107 billion. Sa DPWH pa lang po ito.

asr-000503
00:46:46.580 --> 00:46:50.380
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Sa ND, or Notice of Charge po, tsaka Notice of Disallowance, nasa 50.

asr-000504
00:46:50.740 --> 00:46:53.860
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: 51 billion po. For a total of 158 billion.

asr-000505
00:46:54.990 --> 00:46:57.080
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Na yun mga naman, nabayaran na.

asr-000506
00:46:58.220 --> 00:46:59.660
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Ah, yun po, nabayaran na po.

asr-000507
00:46:59.660 --> 00:47:00.800
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Ayun na, yung problema.

asr-000509
00:47:01.680 --> 00:47:04.220
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Kung siguro pre-audit, hindi nabayaran yan.

asr-000511
00:47:04.560 --> 00:47:07.000
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Tingnan mo yan, billions pa.

asr-000513
00:47:08.460 --> 00:47:12.000
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: That's why, talagang kailangan na kailangan ito.

asr-000514
00:47:14.120 --> 00:47:16.180
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Ah, meron lang po idadagdag, ah, ah po.

asr-000515
00:47:16.380 --> 00:47:16.880
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Yes, ah.

asr-000516
00:47:16.980 --> 00:47:20.260
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Yun pong binanggit nyo kanina, na pre-audit with geo-tagging.

asr-000517
00:47:20.840 --> 00:47:22.420
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Nakalaking bagay po nung word na geo-tagging.

asr-000518
00:47:22.500 --> 00:47:27.020
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Dahil dito po sa fraud audit namin, medyo napapansin po namin,

asr-000519
00:47:27.380 --> 00:47:30.500
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: nahirapan po kaming hanapin yun mismo pong project.

asr-000520
00:47:30.620 --> 00:47:32.960
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: We don't know if it's really ghost or not.

asr-000521
00:47:32.960 --> 00:47:35.500
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Because iba-iba po yung coordinates.

asr-000522
00:47:35.880 --> 00:47:36.200
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Correct.

asr-000523
00:47:37.200 --> 00:47:39.600
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Yung po ang aming, kaya po nahirapan din po ang aming auditor na maghanap.

asr-000524
00:47:39.980 --> 00:47:41.420
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Itinuturo-turo lang po sila.

asr-000525
00:47:41.420 --> 00:47:44.440
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: But yung po ang coordinates, nagbabago po kasi.

asr-000526
00:47:44.540 --> 00:47:44.800
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Yeah.

asr-000528
00:47:45.790 --> 00:47:49.580
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: So, importante din yung geo-tagging.

asr-000529
00:47:51.360 --> 00:47:53.420
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Yep, Mr. Chairman, thank you very much.

asr-000530
00:47:53.540 --> 00:47:56.620
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Unfortunately, mag-expire na yung aking time.

asr-000531
00:47:57.020 --> 00:47:58.320
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: May second round pa naman.

asr-000532
00:47:58.440 --> 00:47:59.540
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Thank you, ah, COA family.

asr-000533
00:48:00.000 --> 00:48:03.500
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Ah, thank you, Representative Mauricio Dumogan, sir.

asr-000534
00:48:05.420 --> 00:48:07.720
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: May we proceed with the minority.

asr-000535
00:48:08.380 --> 00:48:11.980
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Representative Iris Montes, ma'am.

asr-000536
00:48:11.980 --> 00:48:13.460
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-000537
00:48:13.540 --> 00:48:16.180
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Magandang hapon po sa COA, sa ating lahat.

asr-000538
00:48:17.760 --> 00:48:20.940
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Ah, let me begin by saying that alam naman po nating lahat

asr-000539
00:48:20.940 --> 00:48:21.780
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: kung ano ang role namin.

asr-000540
00:48:21.780 --> 00:48:24.900
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Ah, napakahalaga ng role na ginagampanan ng COA,

asr-000541
00:48:25.080 --> 00:48:27.060
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: especially during these times,

asr-000542
00:48:27.180 --> 00:48:30.460
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: na talamak po talaga yung mga issues sa korupsyon.

asr-000543
00:48:31.100 --> 00:48:33.500
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: I cannot overemphasize your role, ano po.

asr-000544
00:48:33.880 --> 00:48:35.760
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: And then, dito din po sa Kongreso,

asr-000545
00:48:35.920 --> 00:48:39.960
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: meron din po kaming oversight functions that we really have to do.

asr-000546
00:48:39.960 --> 00:48:42.480
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: And bahagi po ng oversight function na yan,

asr-000547
00:48:42.480 --> 00:48:45.540
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: ay, ah, nakaasa po kami sa COA

asr-000548
00:48:45.540 --> 00:48:49.220
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: pagdating sa mga AAR, sa annual audit reports.

asr-000549
00:48:49.440 --> 00:48:51.820
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Because, um, I have been in, ah, before being a,

asr-000550
00:48:51.820 --> 00:48:54.960
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Congresswoman, I've been in Congress for the last three decades.

asr-000551
00:48:55.120 --> 00:48:58.420
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: And I would always rely on the audit reports of COA

asr-000552
00:48:58.420 --> 00:49:00.580
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: to be able to frame questions

asr-000553
00:49:00.580 --> 00:49:03.060
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: so that my principal would be able to write,

asr-000554
00:49:03.060 --> 00:49:05.220
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: to ask the right questions, ano.

asr-000555
00:49:06.860 --> 00:49:08.640
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: So, um, itatanong ko po tungkol po,

asr-000556
00:49:08.660 --> 00:49:10.660
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: can you walk us through very briefly

asr-000557
00:49:10.660 --> 00:49:13.240
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: paano po ginagawa ang AARs?

asr-000558
00:49:14.020 --> 00:49:17.380
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Um, halimbawa po for 2026, itong 2026,

asr-000559
00:49:17.640 --> 00:49:20.680
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: can you explain to us very briefly how to go about it?

asr-000560
00:49:29.380 --> 00:49:29.980
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Magandang

asr-000561
00:49:29.980 --> 00:49:30.420
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: hapon po.

asr-000562
00:49:30.420 --> 00:49:35.600
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Um, mamaya po, ah, if you could, ah, give the floor po

asr-000563
00:49:35.600 --> 00:49:37.720
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: to Assistant Commissioner Cese.

asr-000564
00:49:37.980 --> 00:49:40.780
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: But, ah, I would like to give you po an overview

asr-000565
00:49:40.780 --> 00:49:43.360
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: of, ah, the annual audit report.

asr-000566
00:49:43.660 --> 00:49:46.540
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Yung annual audit report po ay katumbas po

asr-000567
00:49:46.540 --> 00:49:48.380
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: ng audited financial statements po

asr-000568
00:49:48.380 --> 00:49:49.480
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: ng mga private companies.

asr-000569
00:49:50.680 --> 00:49:55.800
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Ang may, ah, nakabase po sa aming batas,

asr-000570
00:49:55.840 --> 00:49:57.620
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: ah, Presidential Decree 1445,

asr-000571
00:49:58.730 --> 00:49:59.820
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: ah, we require,

asr-000572
00:49:59.820 --> 00:50:01.540
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: all the auditees po

asr-000573
00:50:01.540 --> 00:50:05.580
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: to, ah, submit their trial balances

asr-000574
00:50:05.580 --> 00:50:10.140
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: or their, um, their initial balance sheet

asr-000575
00:50:10.140 --> 00:50:12.480
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: and income statement on February 14

asr-000576
00:50:12.480 --> 00:50:14.300
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: of the following year.

asr-000577
00:50:14.810 --> 00:50:17.000
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Kaya po kung 2025 po,

asr-000578
00:50:17.080 --> 00:50:19.720
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: they are required to meet the deadline

asr-000579
00:50:19.720 --> 00:50:23.600
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: until February 14 of 2026.

asr-000580
00:50:24.840 --> 00:50:27.880
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Pagkasubmit po nila ng mga trial balances po nila,

asr-000581
00:50:27.880 --> 00:50:29.820
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: um

asr-000582
00:50:29.820 --> 00:50:32.080
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: ang pinakasimula po ng proseso

asr-000583
00:50:32.080 --> 00:50:33.480
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: ng pag-audit po,

asr-000584
00:50:33.580 --> 00:50:35.480
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: nagsisimula pa nga ho yan ng

asr-000585
00:50:35.480 --> 00:50:37.960
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: bago 2026.

asr-000586
00:50:38.340 --> 00:50:40.740
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Meron ho kami mga prosesong tinatawag na

asr-000587
00:50:40.740 --> 00:50:43.380
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: yung mga audit sector po namin,

asr-000588
00:50:43.400 --> 00:50:45.840
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: nag-i-issue po ng mga general audit instructions,

asr-000589
00:50:46.540 --> 00:50:48.160
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: part ho yan ng planning phase.

asr-000590
00:50:48.160 --> 00:50:51.180
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Then, susunod ho yan, bababa pa yan,

asr-000591
00:50:51.180 --> 00:50:53.040
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: at magkakaroon po ng tinatawag namin

asr-000592
00:50:53.200 --> 00:50:55.320
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: specific audit instructions, pababa.

asr-000593
00:50:56.020 --> 00:50:58.420
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: But the actual work begins po

asr-000594
00:50:58.420 --> 00:51:00.240
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: when we start scrutinizing,

asr-000595
00:51:00.240 --> 00:51:03.320
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: the paperwork is when they start submitting

asr-000596
00:51:03.320 --> 00:51:04.260
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: their trial balances.

asr-000597
00:51:04.500 --> 00:51:05.500
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: So February 14.

asr-000598
00:51:06.760 --> 00:51:09.060
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Magkakaroon po kami ng mga tinatawag naming

asr-000599
00:51:09.060 --> 00:51:10.240
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: entrance conferences.

asr-000600
00:51:10.820 --> 00:51:12.740
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: So this is the time that

asr-000601
00:51:12.740 --> 00:51:14.940
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: we start discussing po

asr-000602
00:51:14.940 --> 00:51:16.400
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: with the auditee,

asr-000603
00:51:16.400 --> 00:51:20.940
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: yung dating mga findings po ng COA

asr-000604
00:51:21.520 --> 00:51:24.000
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Kung ano po ang mga naresolva,

asr-000605
00:51:24.120 --> 00:51:25.380
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: kung ano po yung bitin,

asr-000606
00:51:25.380 --> 00:51:27.100
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: at kailangan po hong gawin.

asr-000607
00:51:27.760 --> 00:51:29.860
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: So aside from the financials,

asr-000608
00:51:29.860 --> 00:51:31.880
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: we also take a look at the audit findings

asr-000609
00:51:31.880 --> 00:51:33.980
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: of the previous year and its resolution.

asr-000610
00:51:34.580 --> 00:51:36.240
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Then moving forward po,

asr-000611
00:51:36.320 --> 00:51:38.560
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: yung mga audit teams that are assigned,

asr-000612
00:51:38.780 --> 00:51:42.160
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: assuming po ito ay singular entity,

asr-000613
00:51:42.500 --> 00:51:45.220
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: wala po siyang sabihin nating regional office,

asr-000614
00:51:46.010 --> 00:51:48.080
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: so we only have one audit team

asr-000615
00:51:48.080 --> 00:51:49.280
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: to take a look at this,

asr-000616
00:51:49.280 --> 00:51:51.400
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: and they are given po a deadline

asr-000617
00:51:51.400 --> 00:51:54.280
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: so that by June 30 po,

asr-000618
00:51:54.360 --> 00:51:57.980
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: tapos na po yung kanilang annual audit report.

asr-000619
00:51:57.980 --> 00:51:59.460
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Ito po ay isang overview.

asr-000620
00:51:59.860 --> 00:52:02.820
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: But for certain agencies po

asr-000621
00:52:02.820 --> 00:52:04.900
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: that are multi-office,

asr-000622
00:52:04.960 --> 00:52:07.020
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: tulad ho ng may mga regional offices,

asr-000623
00:52:07.340 --> 00:52:09.640
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: tulad ho ng Department of Education,

asr-000624
00:52:09.980 --> 00:52:12.800
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: na maraming ho silang district schools,

asr-000625
00:52:13.160 --> 00:52:15.160
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: maraming din ho silang regional offices,

asr-000626
00:52:15.160 --> 00:52:17.400
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: So meron ng proseso

asr-000627
00:52:17.400 --> 00:52:19.360
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: sa ibang areas po,

asr-000628
00:52:19.360 --> 00:52:23.100
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: na we start auditing from the ground,

asr-000629
00:52:23.240 --> 00:52:25.700
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: may mga auditors po kami sa iba-ibang region,

asr-000630
00:52:26.560 --> 00:52:28.780
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: they submit their audit reports,

asr-000631
00:52:28.780 --> 00:52:32.020
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: to the central auditing team,

asr-000632
00:52:32.020 --> 00:52:34.420
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: and the central auditing team po

asr-000633
00:52:34.420 --> 00:52:36.020
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: will consolidate these reports.

asr-000634
00:52:36.020 --> 00:52:38.160
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: So we have what we call

asr-000635
00:52:38.160 --> 00:52:41.900
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: the consolidated annual audit reports.

asr-000636
00:52:42.200 --> 00:52:43.960
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: So kung malaki ho yung ahensya,

asr-000637
00:52:44.080 --> 00:52:46.100
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: baka magtaka po kayo,

asr-000638
00:52:46.100 --> 00:52:47.300
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: kakaiba ang tawag ho namin ka-R,

asr-000639
00:52:47.840 --> 00:52:48.980
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: dahil ho consolidated.

asr-000640
00:52:49.600 --> 00:52:51.960
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Yung mga ibang ahensya ho na singular entity,

asr-000641
00:52:52.260 --> 00:52:52.980
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: AR lang po.

asr-000642
00:52:53.480 --> 00:52:55.840
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: But they're all the same po.

asr-000643
00:52:56.280 --> 00:52:58.060
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: So come June 30 po,

asr-000644
00:52:58.160 --> 00:53:01.640
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: ito po ay natapos na po,

asr-000645
00:53:01.720 --> 00:53:03.500
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: nakausap na po yung ahensya.

asr-000646
00:53:03.500 --> 00:53:06.400
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Then comes the reglamentary periods

asr-000647
00:53:06.400 --> 00:53:07.500
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: that we observe,

asr-000648
00:53:07.720 --> 00:53:08.860
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: yung tinatawag ho ni

asr-000649
00:53:08.860 --> 00:53:11.360
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Assistant Commissioner Nilda po,

asr-000650
00:53:11.360 --> 00:53:12.800
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: na may 60 days.

asr-000651
00:53:13.580 --> 00:53:14.620
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Then, eventually po,

asr-000652
00:53:14.720 --> 00:53:17.600
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: based on the General Appropriations Act,

asr-000653
00:53:17.840 --> 00:53:20.360
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: that's the deadline we are given

asr-000654
00:53:20.360 --> 00:53:22.740
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: to publish po sa COA report.

asr-000655
00:53:24.200 --> 00:53:26.980
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Although po, yung publication po namin kakaiba,

asr-000656
00:53:26.980 --> 00:53:28.200
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: sa aming website,

asr-000657
00:53:28.500 --> 00:53:32.960
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: may ibang kakaibang deadline naman po kami sa Kongreso.

asr-000658
00:53:33.500 --> 00:53:37.360
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Dahil po, nauuna rin po kayong nakakatanggap

asr-000659
00:53:37.360 --> 00:53:40.400
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: ng mga audit reports na kinakailangan ho sa budget,

asr-000660
00:53:40.880 --> 00:53:43.740
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: kakaiba naman po yung nilalagay ho namin sa website.

asr-000661
00:53:43.980 --> 00:53:44.860
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Magkapareho yung report.

asr-000662
00:53:45.020 --> 00:53:46.580
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Iba lang po yung panahon

asr-000663
00:53:46.580 --> 00:53:48.840
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: ng aming pagpo-post po sa website.

asr-000664
00:53:49.540 --> 00:53:51.320
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: In other words,

asr-000665
00:53:51.440 --> 00:53:53.260
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: what is the turn-around time?

asr-000666
00:53:53.400 --> 00:53:56.140
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: For instance, yung fiscal year 2024,

asr-000667
00:53:56.640 --> 00:54:01.020
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: kailan po dapat nailabas yung Consolidated Audit Report?

asr-000668
00:54:02.200 --> 00:54:05.140
COA Commissioner Douglas Michael N. Mallillin: Kung fiscal year 2024 po,

asr-000669
00:54:05.240 --> 00:54:09.680
