02:29:38.620 --> 02:29:39.480
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: for fiscal year,

asr-003387
02:29:39.480 --> 02:29:40.240
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: since 2020,

asr-003388
02:29:40.560 --> 02:29:41.520
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: itong ahensyang to,

asr-003389
