Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: sumusuway

asr-003396
02:29:53.220 --> 02:29:56.640
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: o kung pasaway ba talaga, yun po ang kailangan natin.

asr-003397
02:29:56.680 --> 02:30:03.440
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Quality reports, that would help us determine kung tama ba ang ibinibigay natin.

asr-003398
