Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Pondo, kaya ba nilang gastusin yan?

asr-003399
02:30:05.460 --> 02:30:09.680
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: We talk about yung absorptive capacity and all.

asr-003400
02:30:09.780 --> 02:30:13.540
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: We can see that sa reports, kung may tracking po tayo, tama po.

asr-003401
02:30:13.540 --> 02:30:23.540
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: So yun lamang po ay support yung manifestation na ibigyan po kayo ng nire-request yung MOE.

asr-003402
02:30:24.240 --> 02:30:30.560
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Pero po, pinapakiusap ko na sana ibigyan natin ng prioridad yung mga pagkakagastusan

asr-003403
02:30:30.560 --> 02:30:35.300
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: that would help us do our job na mas maging efficient tayo,

asr-003404
02:30:35.300 --> 02:30:40.360
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: mas magkaroon po tayo ng quality, comprehensive annual reports

asr-003405
02:30:40.360 --> 02:30:42.920
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: na kayang intindihin po ng layman,

asr-003406
02:30:43.080 --> 02:30:46.240
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: kayang intindihin po ng members of Congress

asr-003407
02:30:46.240 --> 02:30:48.680
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: so that we can help you also do your job.

asr-003408
02:30:48.820 --> 02:30:50.600
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Chair.

asr-003409
02:30:57.820 --> 02:30:59.720
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Representative Montes, salamat po.

asr-003410
02:30:59.720 --> 02:31:06.260
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: I'd like to acknowledge, although belatedly, our Vice Chair, Bernadette Escudero, ma'am.

asr-003411
02:31:10.920 --> 02:31:18.660
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: We now give the floor to our Chairperson of the Committee on Appropriation.

asr-003412
02:31:25.510 --> 02:31:26.880
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much.

asr-003413
02:31:27.000 --> 02:31:33.320
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Vice Chair Cagas, I just wanted to first of all say thank you to our Vice Chair

asr-003414
02:31:33.320 --> 02:31:37.420
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: and the Budget Sponsor for COA, Vice Chair John Tracy Cagas,

asr-003415
02:31:37.920 --> 02:31:41.140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: for doing such a great job in managing today's hearings.

asr-003416
02:31:41.440 --> 02:31:45.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And you have a very able partner po.

asr-003417
02:31:47.040 --> 02:31:52.940
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Talaga pong sinigurado po namin, Chair, that COA is in great hands with your Budget Sponsor.

asr-003418
02:31:52.940 --> 02:31:56.400
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And he and we will be your partners.

asr-003419
02:31:56.860 --> 02:32:01.920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: We've been advocating for the budget of COA until the very end,

asr-003420
02:32:02.060 --> 02:32:07.640
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: from the approval of HGAB to BICAM until GAA.

asr-003421
02:32:07.780 --> 02:32:15.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Alam niyo naman po yan, last year, we helped COA with the requirements sa building.

asr-003422
02:32:15.460 --> 02:32:17.980
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Kamusta na po ba yung building ninyo, Chair?

asr-003423
02:32:18.320 --> 02:32:19.180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Okay na?

asr-003424
02:32:19.180 --> 02:32:23.300
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Hindi na yung takot na guguho siya at any given point.

asr-003425
02:32:24.060 --> 02:32:25.240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Okay, good, good.

asr-003426
02:32:25.400 --> 02:32:26.740
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Kasi po, last year po,

asr-003427
02:32:26.780 --> 02:32:33.160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: we asked po, Chair, as to what is the most pressing concern for COA.

asr-003428
02:32:33.160 --> 02:32:37.340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And it's really the safety and the well-being of the employees in the building.

asr-003429
02:32:37.540 --> 02:32:43.460
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, sana po yung naibigay po natin na additional funding last year.

asr-003430
02:32:43.860 --> 02:32:48.920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But now, at least mo kampante na po na hindi na po guguho yung building.

asr-003431
02:32:49.200 --> 02:32:50.620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: At tagal-tagal na po.

asr-003432
02:32:51.540 --> 02:32:52.340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: 1970s pa ba?

asr-003433
02:32:53.740 --> 02:32:55.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: 1960s pa yung building.

asr-003434
02:32:55.300 --> 02:32:56.760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, alam niyo po.

asr-003435
02:32:57.020 --> 02:32:58.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: We're always your partners.

asr-003436
02:32:58.260 --> 02:33:01.440
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And you're doing such important work in COA.

asr-003437
02:33:01.440 --> 02:33:09.940
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: As Kong Iris manifested, the output of your work is a great input to us exercising our oversight function.

asr-003438
02:33:10.280 --> 02:33:17.620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, what we can do on our part po is to give you the resources to be able to perform your mandate better.

asr-003439
02:33:17.840 --> 02:33:22.060
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, I'm happy to hear po, Chair, na okay na yung building natin.

asr-003440
02:33:22.100 --> 02:33:26.680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: If I may ask po, because I was looking through the 2027.

asr-003441
02:33:27.160 --> 02:33:29.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: For COA.

asr-003442
02:33:29.480 --> 02:33:35.760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And ang talagang standout dito is zero yung capital outlay.

asr-003443
02:33:35.920 --> 02:33:47.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And I just wanted to ask po, whether there's a particular explanation that DBM gave as to why the whole proposal for capital outlay was zeroed out.

asr-003444
02:33:47.620 --> 02:33:50.540
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: There was none po, Your Honor.

asr-003445
02:33:51.000 --> 02:33:56.640
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But all of these po, you indicated here that the proposal included,

asr-003446
02:33:56.640 --> 02:34:01.020
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: it included a 1.17, 1.18 billion proposal.

asr-003447
02:34:01.400 --> 02:34:04.620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But there was no explanation po as to why.

asr-003448
02:34:04.740 --> 02:34:05.820
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Kasi iba-iba naman siya.

asr-003449
02:34:06.060 --> 02:34:07.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: It's not all ICT.

asr-003450
02:34:07.740 --> 02:34:11.600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: There's also buildings and vehicles.

asr-003451
02:34:11.780 --> 02:34:18.800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But it was all, even the one po in NIR, pati yun hindi nila in-approve.

asr-003452
02:34:18.800 --> 02:34:20.800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yes, one vehicle for the NIR.

asr-003453
02:34:21.740 --> 02:34:22.380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Interesting.

asr-003454
02:34:23.660 --> 02:34:24.800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Sige po, SDS.

asr-003456
02:34:25.160 --> 02:34:29.920
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Pwede bang mag-conduct kayo ng audit sa DBM?

asr-003457
02:34:31.600 --> 02:34:34.660
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Para siguro palagay ko, bibigay nila yung request nyo.

asr-003458
02:34:34.820 --> 02:34:36.340
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Gawin nyo yun bago mag-budget.

asr-003459
02:34:36.900 --> 02:34:40.060
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Bago niya ibigay sa presidente yung budget.

asr-003460
02:34:40.340 --> 02:34:42.380
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Sa sunod pwede special audit na.

asr-003461
02:34:43.540 --> 02:34:44.560
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Thank you, Che.

asr-003462
02:34:45.880 --> 02:34:47.860
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you, SDS.

asr-003463
02:34:47.860 --> 02:34:54.820
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, just to understand po, because medyo generic po yung pagkalagay dito po sa presentation.

asr-003464
02:34:56.180 --> 02:34:59.280
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: First year implementation of COA ISSP.

asr-003465
02:34:59.280 --> 02:35:03.600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: For 2027, ah, 2027 to 2029.

asr-003466
02:35:05.800 --> 02:35:08.240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Is there a, do you have a road map po?

asr-003467
02:35:08.360 --> 02:35:12.120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Because I remember, Chair, this was a conversation that we had last year.

asr-003468
02:35:12.120 --> 02:35:22.140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: That the previous ICT road map that was commenced a few years prior was no longer up-to-date.

asr-003469
02:35:22.280 --> 02:35:26.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Medyo nagiging obsolete na yung laman ng previous ICT road map.

asr-003470
02:35:27.240 --> 02:35:29.340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, is this a completely new road map?

asr-003471
02:35:30.020 --> 02:35:36.620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: This is not a continuation of the previous road map that was rendered obsolete.

asr-003472
02:35:37.600 --> 02:35:38.580
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: Yes, Pa.

asr-003473
02:35:39.080 --> 02:35:40.400
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-003474
02:35:40.400 --> 02:35:45.560
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: Because this was reviewed by the ICT and endorsed it to DBM.

asr-003475
02:35:46.060 --> 02:35:55.100
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: So, this is a complete road map for five years where we emphasize the digitalization of our day-to-day operations.

asr-003476
02:35:55.400 --> 02:35:59.600
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: Particularly, on the use of the subscription to software.

asr-003477
02:36:00.240 --> 02:36:03.320
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: ICT equipment to enhance the quality of our audit.

asr-003478
02:36:03.540 --> 02:36:07.140
COA Assistant Commissioner Lorna Cabochan: And this was endorsed by the ICT to DBM.

asr-003479
02:36:07.760 --> 02:36:11.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: If we may request for a more detailed...

asr-003480
02:36:11.040 --> 02:36:11.560
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yes.

asr-003481
02:36:12.180 --> 02:36:16.260
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: If we can request a more detailed plan for this, how much?

asr-003482
02:36:16.320 --> 02:36:21.160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Because nakikita ko pa, it's 1.18 billion for the entire capital outlay request.

asr-003483
02:36:21.380 --> 02:36:25.760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, if we could get some details on the ICT request.

asr-003484
02:36:26.200 --> 02:36:27.700
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And then for the building, po.

asr-003485
02:36:27.880 --> 02:36:29.420
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Proposals for buildings.

asr-003486
02:36:29.420 --> 02:36:32.900
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And other structures and furniture and fixtures.

asr-003487
02:36:32.900 --> 02:36:36.140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Originally proposed in 2026.

asr-003488
02:36:36.140 --> 02:36:37.440
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But was not considered.

asr-003489
02:36:37.740 --> 02:36:40.880
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: May I ask, po, for additional information on that?

asr-003490
02:36:42.080 --> 02:36:47.900
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: On the building, we have the modernization of the COA main building facade.

asr-003491
02:36:48.360 --> 02:36:50.020
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: Fire protection works.

asr-003492
02:36:50.400 --> 02:36:55.580
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: Renovation of our professional development center building.

asr-003493
02:36:57.100 --> 02:37:01.140
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: And the construction of building in NIR.

asr-003494
02:37:02.140 --> 02:37:08.920
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: Then, we have also the construction of the two-story records of storage building in Ordeneta.

asr-003495
02:37:09.900 --> 02:37:18.100
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: Then, the construction of our three-story office training center and dormitory in Region 9.

asr-003496
02:37:18.100 --> 02:37:20.800
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: And also Region 10.

asr-003497
02:37:22.480 --> 02:37:28.880
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: And the training center and dormitory building in Pisao, Sultan Kudarat.

asr-003498
02:37:30.940 --> 02:37:32.840
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: That's for the building and other structures.

asr-003499
02:37:33.870 --> 02:37:36.520
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: Then, we have also the other structures.

asr-003500
02:37:36.780 --> 02:37:44.380
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: Upgrading of main distribution panel and low voltage switch gear for COA main buildings 1 and 2.

asr-003501
02:37:45.990 --> 02:37:54.340
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: And the upgrading of main distribution panel and low voltage switch gear for various COA central office buildings.

asr-003502
02:37:54.780 --> 02:38:00.220
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: And also the upgrading of our powerhouse for our dormitory.

asr-003503
02:38:03.280 --> 02:38:05.580
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: Then, the furniture and fixtures.

asr-003504
02:38:06.160 --> 02:38:10.460
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: This is for the additional funding for building 2.

asr-003505
02:38:12.260 --> 02:38:23.740
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: And the creation of NIR for the building to be constructed.

asr-003506
02:38:23.740 --> 02:38:28.080
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: Then, the transportation for the three vehicles.

asr-003507
02:38:28.080 --> 02:38:30.720
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: And the ICT equipment.

asr-003508
02:38:30.720 --> 02:38:32.440
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: And software.

asr-003509
02:38:32.860 --> 02:38:36.900
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: So, that's for the capital outlay, Your Honor.

asr-003510
02:38:37.620 --> 02:38:39.240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Andami po palang components.

asr-003511
02:38:39.720 --> 02:38:44.420
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, for us to get a better sense, because given the limited fiscal space,

asr-003512
02:38:46.200 --> 02:38:49.500
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: realistically, we would not be able to fund all.

asr-003513
02:38:49.500 --> 02:39:00.580
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, for us to get a better sense, again, may we request for a more detailed list of all of the items under the capital outlay request.

asr-003514
02:39:00.580 --> 02:39:02.820
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: With the corresponding details.

asr-003515
02:39:03.260 --> 02:39:20.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And then, Chair Leal, if I may request lang po, for you to be able to, if it's okay po, if you could give us a list of, like, a list of, essentially a wish list of all the items that were left out in the NEP that COA wishes to advocate for.

asr-003516
02:39:20.580 --> 02:39:31.920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Because, as we mentioned before, one of the main reforms that we've done last year in the Committee on Appropriations and here in Congress is we institutionalized a budget amendments review subcommittee

asr-003517
02:39:31.920 --> 02:39:40.200
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: wherein we are deliberating on the institutional amendment requests emanating from the different agencies.

asr-003518
02:39:40.500 --> 02:39:48.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, open po yun, kita ng mga kababayan natin line by line, which amendments we are deliberating on and where the funds are going.

asr-003519
02:39:48.820 --> 02:39:51.780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, siguro po, Chair, medyo andami po kasi.

asr-003520
02:39:51.980 --> 02:40:01.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: When we receive the wish list po, or the request for institutional amendments, kung saan na po pwede po kung nakaprioritize na po.

asr-003521
02:40:02.300 --> 02:40:11.900
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Because the worst that could happen is if we're able to find additional fiscal space, mali yung malagyan namin na program, hindi naman po pala yun yung priority ng COA.

asr-003522
02:40:12.100 --> 02:40:27.180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, Chair, if we may request for that document, if possible, this week, because we plan on convening the BARC either next week or the week after, before the plenary po, so we can have time to deliberate on them.

asr-003523
02:40:27.540 --> 02:40:29.100
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yan po, Chair.

asr-003524
02:40:29.500 --> 02:40:31.440
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: We'll do that po, ma'am. Thank you very much.

asr-003525
02:40:31.440 --> 02:40:32.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you so much po.

asr-003526
02:40:32.540 --> 02:40:38.260
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And then, Chair, lastly, this was something that I also raised last year.

asr-003527
02:40:38.460 --> 02:40:52.400
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: This is with regard to the submission of the COA reports from the previous year to aid us in our analysis of the different agencies for their budgetary requirements for the succeeding year.

asr-003528
02:40:52.680 --> 02:40:58.600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, we checked po, may tatlo na lang po na agencies na kulang.

asr-003529
02:40:58.720 --> 02:41:02.200
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: DPWH, NHA, and Judiciary.

asr-003530
02:41:02.340 --> 02:41:14.260
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Para po magamit po namin, we can leverage on the COA audit reports as we do our assessment and scrutiny of the budget of the different agencies.

asr-003531
02:41:14.460 --> 02:41:20.280
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, aside from their budget utilization rates, yung audit reports, magamit din po namin na basihan.

asr-003532
02:41:20.780 --> 02:41:28.160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yung audit findings, para po magamit din po namin basihan kung saan po natin ilalagay yung pondo.

asr-003533
02:41:28.260 --> 02:41:39.180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, i-request po namin, Chair, lalo na nandito yung DPWH, if we may receive that as soon as possible po.

asr-003534
02:41:41.720 --> 02:41:44.420
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Yesterday po, ma'am, nasubmit na daw po ang DPWH.

asr-003535
02:41:45.940 --> 02:41:47.720
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: I'll check yung NHA and Judiciary.

asr-003536
02:41:48.340 --> 02:41:49.580
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But the...

asr-003537
